      "chunkIndex": 2,
      "contentPreview": "THE SPEC WAS WRONG AND WAS AMENDED BEFORE PLANNING. The original design said the fix was widening the wire DTOs. Tracing one write end to end showed that was necessary but not sufficient: IMemoryStore.WriteArtifactAsync had NO parameter capable of carrying metadata, and the only construction of StoreApiRequest passed content and name only \u2014 nothing else had ever crossed that wire. The spec\u0027s F8 (\u0022Upsert\u0027s no-op is on purpose, the server performs those writes\u0022) was wrong: the no-op WAS the data l",
