      "chunkIndex": 4,
      "contentPreview": "LOCAL/REMOTE AND MCP/REST DIVERGENCES THAT REMAIN. (1) BM25 term frequencies differ by store mode, so search RANKING differs local vs remote. Two causes: the client re-sends mergedKeywords and the server reclassifies them all as agent-supplied (\u002B5 where local gave auto terms \u002B2); and locally SeedTermFrequencies runs before the carrier merge so tag/review/anchor/file are never seeded, while over the wire they arrive in one flat map the server seeds wholesale. Not fixable by moving the merge \u2014 the",
